 If you use Claude Code, also run `herdr integration install claude`. Without it,
 a session you opened with a slash command and never prompted stays `claude`.
 
+This WSL installation includes a local compatibility fix for Claude Code's
+`custom-title` / `customTitle` transcript records, alongside `ai-title` /
+`aiTitle`. The latest non-empty title names the session. Reinstalling or updating
+the plugin replaces this local fix until upstream includes equivalent support.
+
+Local Copilot title normalization also removes the trailing ` - GitHub Copilot`
+from activity labels before formatting tab, pane, and workspace topic names.
+Other agents and product names within a session name are unchanged. Updating or
+reinstalling the plugin replaces this customization too.
+
